Package: ryoku-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, apt, dpkg
Description: Ryoku Desktop Control Plane and Host Abstraction
 Provides the ryoku CLI command for desktop management, doctor diagnostics,
 and ryoku-host abstraction daemon interfacing with APT and systemd.

Package: ryoku-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, quickshell
Description: Ryoku Desktop Shell IPC and supervision daemon
 Provides the ryoku-shell Go IPC daemon, live wallpaper engine, and shell scripts.

Package: ryoku-palette-bridge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ryoku Palette Bridge for dynamic wallpaper-derived color sync
 Interfaces between Matugen color extraction and applications.

